# "Whenever a Dragon you control enters" counts tokens (CR 603.6a, 111.1): Feywild Caretaker's end step trigger on turn 3 creates a
# 1/1 Faerie Dragon token, which enters under Bot1's control as a Dragon, so Sarkhan gets a +1/+1 counter (3/3) and is a Dragon with
# flying until the end of that turn - still so when the token enters during the end step. The Caretaker (an Orc Wizard) entering
# earlier in the turn did nothing: Sarkhan was a 2/2 until the token came. With no Dragon to behold on turn 1 nothing was asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Sarkhan, Dragon Ascendant
Feywild Caretaker
Island
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

